. *    person and k is a number of POINTS.
. *    EXPECT: N_100 exactly 100; Dist_100 strictly positive; and the
. *    nine rows without coordinates receiving missing results rather
. *    than a wrong answer.
. * ==================================================================
. capture noisily {
.     use "$EQP_DATA", clear
.     equipop, x(X_local) y(Y_local) k(100)
